    {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is Cartesia, and what does the Sonic TTS API do in 2026?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Cartesia is a San Francisco voice AI lab that built Sonic, a real-time text-to-speech model optimized for conversational AI agents. The Sonic API delivers 90ms TTFB on English text — the lowest latency among commercial TTS APIs in 2026 — via a state-space-model architecture similar to Mamba. Cartesia also ships Sonic 2 (29+ languages with built-in voice cloning), Onyx (STT), Mistral (text-to-voice design), and Pleroma (5-second voice cloning). The API is at https://api.cartesia.ai with a 10K-character/month free tier."}},
